Package: divpatterns
Title: Patterns of Protein Evolutionary Divergence
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Julian", "Echave", , "jechave@unsam.edu.ar", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-0678-5593")),
    person("University of Pittsburgh and contributors", role = "cph",
           comment = "3Dmol.js library, bundled in inst/viewer; see inst/COPYRIGHTS")
  )
Description: Functions to calculate and analyse patterns of protein
    evolutionary divergence at the sequence, structure and motion levels,
    from homologous proteins, given their structures and a sequence alignment.
